  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 6044,
      "text": "By the sun and its brightness,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 91,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشَّمۡسِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shams",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sun",
        "numberOfAyahs": 15,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 595,
      "ruku": 533,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6045,
      "text": "and by the moon as it follows it[1],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 91,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشَّمۡسِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shams",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sun",
        "numberOfAyahs": 15,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 595,
      "ruku": 533,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6046,
      "text": "and by the day as it displays it[2],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 91,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشَّمۡسِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shams",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sun",
        "numberOfAyahs": 15,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 595,
      "ruku": 533,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6047,
      "text": "and by the night as it covers it[3],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 91,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشَّمۡسِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shams",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sun",
        "numberOfAyahs": 15,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 595,
      "ruku": 533,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6048,
      "text": "and by the sky and how He made it,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 91,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشَّمۡسِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shams",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sun",
        "numberOfAyahs": 15,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 595,
      "ruku": 533,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6049,
      "text": "and by the earth and how He spread it,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 91,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشَّمۡسِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shams",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sun",
        "numberOfAyahs": 15,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 595,
      "ruku": 533,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6050,
      "text": "and by the soul and how He fashioned it[4],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 91,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشَّمۡسِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shams",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sun",
        "numberOfAyahs": 15,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 595,
      "ruku": 533,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6051,
      "text": "then inspired it [to know] its wickedness and righteousness,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 91,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشَّمۡسِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shams",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sun",
        "numberOfAyahs": 15,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 595,
      "ruku": 533,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6052,
      "text": "Indeed, he who purifies his soul will attain success,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 91,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشَّمۡسِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shams",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sun",
        "numberOfAyahs": 15,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 595,
      "ruku": 533,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6053,
      "text": "and he who corrupts it will be doomed.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 91,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشَّمۡسِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shams",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sun",
        "numberOfAyahs": 15,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 595,
      "ruku": 533,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6054,
      "text": "Thamūd rejected [the messenger] because of their transgression,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 91,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشَّمۡسِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shams",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sun",
        "numberOfAyahs": 15,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 595,
      "ruku": 533,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6055,
      "text": "when the most wretched among them rose[5].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 91,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشَّمۡسِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shams",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sun",
        "numberOfAyahs": 15,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 595,
      "ruku": 533,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6056,
      "text": "Although the messenger of Allah warned them, “Hands off the she-camel of Allah and her drink!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 91,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشَّمۡسِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shams",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sun",
        "numberOfAyahs": 15,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 595,
      "ruku": 533,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6057,
      "text": "Yet they rejected him and hamstrung her[6]. So their Lord destroyed them for their sin and leveled them to the ground.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 91,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشَّمۡسِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shams",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sun",
        "numberOfAyahs": 15,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 595,
      "ruku": 533,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6058,
      "text": "And He has no fear of the consequences thereof[7].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 91,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشَّمۡسِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shams",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sun",
        "numberOfAyahs": 15,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 595,
      "ruku": 533,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6059,
      "text": "By the night when it covers[1],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 92,
        "name": "سُورَةُ اللَّيۡلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Lail",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night",
        "numberOfAyahs": 21,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 595,
      "ruku": 534,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6060,
      "text": "and by the day when it appears,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 92,
        "name": "سُورَةُ اللَّيۡلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Lail",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night",
        "numberOfAyahs": 21,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 595,
      "ruku": 534,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6061,
      "text": "and by His creation of male and female,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 92,
        "name": "سُورَةُ اللَّيۡلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Lail",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night",
        "numberOfAyahs": 21,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 595,
      "ruku": 534,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6062,
      "text": "surely your efforts are divergent.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 92,
        "name": "سُورَةُ اللَّيۡلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Lail",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night",
        "numberOfAyahs": 21,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 595,
      "ruku": 534,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6063,
      "text": "As for the one who gives in charity and fears Allah,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 92,
        "name": "سُورَةُ اللَّيۡلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Lail",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night",
        "numberOfAyahs": 21,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 595,
      "ruku": 534,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6064,
      "text": "and truly believes in the best reward,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 92,
        "name": "سُورَةُ اللَّيۡلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Lail",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night",
        "numberOfAyahs": 21,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 595,
      "ruku": 534,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6065,
      "text": "We will make easy for him the way of salvation.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 92,
        "name": "سُورَةُ اللَّيۡلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Lail",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night",
        "numberOfAyahs": 21,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 595,
      "ruku": 534,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6066,
      "text": "But as for the one who is miserly and deems himself self-sufficient,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 92,
        "name": "سُورَةُ اللَّيۡلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Lail",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night",
        "numberOfAyahs": 21,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 595,
      "ruku": 534,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6067,
      "text": "and denies the best reward,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 92,
        "name": "سُورَةُ اللَّيۡلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Lail",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night",
        "numberOfAyahs": 21,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 595,
      "ruku": 534,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6068,
      "text": "We will make easy for him the way of perdition.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 92,
        "name": "سُورَةُ اللَّيۡلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Lail",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night",
        "numberOfAyahs": 21,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 595,
      "ruku": 534,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6069,
      "text": "His wealth will be of no avail to him when he tumbles [into Hell].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 92,
        "name": "سُورَةُ اللَّيۡلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Lail",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night",
        "numberOfAyahs": 21,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 595,
      "ruku": 534,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6070,
      "text": "Indeed, it is upon Us to show the right way,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 92,
        "name": "سُورَةُ اللَّيۡلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Lail",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night",
        "numberOfAyahs": 21,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 595,
      "ruku": 534,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6071,
      "text": "and surely to Us belong the Hereafter and the present life.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 92,
        "name": "سُورَةُ اللَّيۡلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Lail",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night",
        "numberOfAyahs": 21,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 595,
      "ruku": 534,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6072,
      "text": "So I warn you of a raging Fire,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 92,
        "name": "سُورَةُ اللَّيۡلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Lail",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night",
        "numberOfAyahs": 21,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 595,
      "ruku": 534,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
